[{"id":5227189324,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN5CUTA","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"dfaac62e08308d1bb3d1bfe3db6bc621e368f30a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally with the MRP of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123325, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nWith **Bake Navigation** enabled on the GridMap node, and visible collision shapes + visible navigation:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"534\" height=\"269\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97f71747-1817-4b3f-a8de-66315e49a4ee\" />\r\n\r\nI'll take care to document this in the manual when this is merged.\r\n\r\nPS: When testing this PR, I also realized we don't have OccluderInstance3D baking support for GridMap (similar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2910). Since GridMap has no dedicated slot for occluders like it does for collision and navigation, baking an occluder would naturally seem like the way to go. Also, a single merged occluder should perform better than thousands of individual occluder instances.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123520#pullrequestreview-5227189324","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123520","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-09-16T19:09:15Z"},{"id":5228208022,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN6Aflg","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"dfaac62e08308d1bb3d1bfe3db6bc621e368f30a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url"